2498:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\        should not be written until the flush operation is complete.
2499:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_eth.c **** *\*\        This function causes all data in the Tx FIFO to be lost or flushed.
